  "description": "Four cardinal frontier bases expand toward a cross of clear approach lanes. Large diagonal gas giants force fleets around their gravity wells, while surrounding nebula banks reduce sensors and offer concealed flanking routes; nebulae are not impassable walls. Each start has an equally close mining field and temperate colony outside the clouds. Four inner mining pockets reward control of the approaches; the open outer rim remains an alternative to the central chokepoints.",
